{
  "borough": "Wandsworth",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would combine a family sized dwelling with a non-family-sized \r\ndwelling, with the total floorspace of the new dwelling created being more than 130sqm. The proposal would therefore result in harm to the supply and choice of housing within the borough and fails to comply with policy H8 of the London Plan (2021) and policy LP25 of Wandsworth Local Plan (2023).\r\n",
    "Reason : 2 - In dealing with this application the Council has implemented the requirement in the National Planning Policy Framework to make available detailed advice in the form of our statutory policies in the Local Plan as well as offering a full pre application advice service. However, we have been unable to seek solutions to problems as the principle of the proposal is clearly contrary to our statutory policies and negotiation could not overcome the reasons for refusal.\r\n"
  ],
